268: 2. Preserve relevant tracked/untracked files with secret-free local snapshots/patches before editing. Put execution artifacts under `docs/test-results/search`, separate from application code. Exclude `.env*`, credentials, signing material, saved account/session data, and private message payloads. Fixtures use synthetic text. Store source path/hash metadata without copying secrets. Do not package the whole repository.
